   ],
   "code": 1,
   "out": "FAIL: layer violations not in the baseline:\n  app.domain -> socket  (domain -> io)\n  domain purity: move the IO behind a port in the application layer, implemented in an adapter; or accept the edge once with `oo-ratchet layers --update --allow-config-change --source <ref>`\n",
